tests/

# Receipted measurement apparatus. A benchmark receipt binds `source_tree` and
# the generated outputs by sha256 to the commit the measurement ran at, so that
# a published number stays tamper-evident. Editing this tree's prose, even only
# its punctuation, invalidates that binding and `scripts/check_benchmark_docs.py`
# fails. Fixing it means re-running the benchmark, which would change what the
# numbers mean, so the prose here is left as measured.
benchmarks/
